mber, as well as the upper bound of the 95% prediction interval\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Observed numbers of deaths are weighted to account for incomplete reporting by jurisdictions\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"negative values were treated as 0 excess deaths\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The lower end of this range corresponds to the total number above the upper bound of the 95% prediction intervals\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"R statistical software (version 3.5.0; The R Foundation) was used to conduct all analyses\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}